          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akawushimira Imana, akawumanyagura, akavuga, at’ Uyu n’umubiri wanje ubatangiwe, murahora mugira murtya kugira ngo kibe icibutso canje. ",
          "type": "text",
